UPDATE public.products
SET 
  description = E'Juvéderm Ultra 4 with Lidocaine is an injectable hyaluronic acid (HA) dermal filler manufactured by Allergan, designed for the correction of deep folds, facial volume restoration, and lip augmentation. As part of the Juvéderm range — first approved by the U.S. Food and Drug Administration in June 2006 — the product uses cross-linked hyaluronic acid, a substance naturally present in human skin, muscles, and tendons, that helps maintain volume and hydration.\n\nThe Ultra 4 formulation features a thicker, more cohesive cross-linked HA gel intended for injection into the deep dermis, providing long-lasting correction of pronounced wrinkles such as nasolabial folds (smile lines), marionette lines, and for restoring volume to areas like the cheeks, chin, and lips. The integrated lidocaine reduces discomfort during the injection procedure.\n\nKey characteristics:\n• Active ingredient: Cross-linked hyaluronic acid 24 mg/ml\n• Anesthetic: Lidocaine hydrochloride 3 mg/ml\n• Indication: Deep wrinkle correction, lip augmentation, facial volume restoration\n• Application depth: Deep dermis / subcutaneous\n• Duration: Typically 9–12 months depending on injection site and patient metabolism\n• Pack size: 2 prefilled syringes × 1 ml, with sterile needles\n• Storage: 2 °C – 25 °C, protected from light and freezing\n\nBecause hyaluronic acid binds water (up to 1,000 times its own weight), Juvéderm Ultra 4 hydrates tissue while restoring volume, helping aging skin appear smoother and more youthful. The cross-linking process binds individual HA chains into a durable gel, extending the longevity of correction compared with non-cross-linked HA, which the body would otherwise metabolise within hours.\n\nFor professional medical use only. Must be administered by trained, licensed healthcare practitioners. Not suitable for patients with severe allergies, a history of anaphylaxis, or hypersensitivity to bacterial proteins or lidocaine.',
  image_url = 'https://rutasxqwqxdyzjdzmxrk.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/product-images/juvederm-ultra-4-lidocaine-1ml-main.jpg',
